{
  "post": {
    "id": "1691470",
    "published": "2015-11-24T18:14:16.000Z",
    "title": "お腹すいてる人は見ちゃダメ！絶対だよ！",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/1691470.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170323081109/http://lineblog.me/kano/archives/1691470.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "こんにちは、鹿乃です"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你好，我是鹿乃。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hello, I'm Kano"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "235cc7ea408b.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/3/ic_biccuri02.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "先週に引き続いて今週からは冬コミに向けて大忙し…！のはずが、風邪でダウンしてしまいました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这周也要接着上周，为冬Comi忙得不可开交……！本该如此，结果却因为感冒病倒了。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Continuing from last week, this week is supposed to be a super busy push toward Winter Comiket...! But I went down with a cold."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "生放送します〜〜って公式LINEでみんなにメッセージ送ってたのにごめんなさい💦"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "明明已经在官方 LINE 上给大家发消息说“要开生放送啦〜〜”，结果却病倒了，对不起💦"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'd sent everyone a message on the official LINE saying I'd do a live broadcast, so I'm sorry 💦"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "お詫びにお蔵入りになった鹿乃のプチ失敗お写真を…。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "作为赔礼，就放出几张被鹿乃雪藏起来的小失败照片吧……。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As an apology, here's a photo of one of Kano's little failures that got shelved..."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "d2c440e7d915.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/1/f/1f72e664.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "なんのお写真でしょう！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "猜猜这是什么照片！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What could this photo be?!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "正解は〜〜〜〜"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "正确答案是〜〜〜〜"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The answer is~~~~"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ディアブレイブのストリングス収録後のお写真です。説明しないとなんの写真かわからないですよね。そうなんです。もう二度とないチャンスだったのに、ストリングスの収録があまりにも圧巻だし素敵すぎだしで聴くのに夢中で気付いたら終わっていて、片付けられはじめていたという……。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这是《Dear Brave》弦乐录音结束后的照片。不说明的话，根本看不出是什么照片吧。是啊，就是这样。明明是这样千载难逢的机会，可弦乐录制实在太震撼、太美妙了，我听得入了神，回过神来已经录完了，工作人员都开始收拾了……。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It's a photo taken after the strings recording for \"Dear brave\". You can't tell what it is without an explanation, right? Right. It was a once-in-a-lifetime chance, but the strings recording was so overwhelming and so wonderful that I got completely absorbed in listening, and when I noticed, it was over and they were already packing up..."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ううう。みんなにも観て欲しかった。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "呜呜呜。真想让大家都亲眼看到。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Uuuuu. I wanted you all to see it too."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "いやでもほら！音源からどれくらい凄かったか伝わるし？！？！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "哎呀不过你看！光从音源里也能感受到有多厉害吧？！？！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "But hey! You can tell how amazing it was from the recording, right?!?!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "youtube",
        "videoId": "UstE6yTlwcU",
        "watch": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UstE6yTlwcU",
        "video": "b04cdeafa13e.mp4",
        "cover": "fb21653eb79c.jpg",
        "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20170323081109/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UstE6yTlwcU",
        "coverSource": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UstE6yTlwcU/hqdefault.jpg"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "ディアブレイブ  (TV アニメ 「へヴィーオブジェクト」 エンディングテーマ)",
            "source": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/517s3E3VFrL._SL160_.jpg",
            "media": "2dbbd15e05ab.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "link",
            "href": "http://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B01520YADK",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "ディアブレイブ"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "改めて写真フォルダの中を観ると、失敗したお写真多いな〜〜"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "重新翻了翻相册，发现失败的照片还真不少呢〜〜"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Looking through my photo folder again, there sure are a lot of failed photos~~"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "97c3395678fe.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/8/c/8c599a48.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "これは失敗じゃないよ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这张可不是失败哦"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This one isn't a failure"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "772f32d89f57.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/3/b/3b02a240.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "これも失敗じゃないよ"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这张也不是失败哦"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This one isn't a failure either"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "d8f7bf61915e.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/6/a/6a1c339e.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "＼これもまったく失敗じゃないよ／"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "＼这张也完全不失败哦／"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "＼This one is totally not a failure either／"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ここ一ヶ月で食べた美味しいものの写真（主に名古屋飯）を自慢げに貼りつつ、今回は筆を置きたいと思います。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "一边得意地贴出这一个月来吃到的美食照片（主要是名古屋美食），这次的博客就打算写到这儿啦。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'll put down my brush here, proudly pasting photos of the delicious things I've eaten over the past month (mainly Nagoya food)."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "みんなはもうお昼食べましたか？鹿乃はまだです。おなかすいた〜〜！！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "大家已经吃过午饭了吗？鹿乃还没吃呢。肚子好饿〜〜！！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Have you all eaten lunch yet? Kano hasn't. I'm hungry~~!!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "titleZh": "肚子饿的人不许看！绝对哦！",
    "titleEn": "Don't Look If You're Hungry! Seriously!"
  },
